  "releaseNotes": "## v1.1.27 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.1.26:\n\n- fix: accept Nullable element types in the ordered containers without a comparer [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: stop RingBuffer.Resample's index mapping overflowing for large buffers [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: keep the stored key when ContiguousMap's indexer updates a value [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: release cleared elements in RingBuffer.Clear [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
